Func print
New __Escape_std.io.print_ARG0 <msg>
Escape std.io.print
End

New file 'test.txt'
New data '\tWelcome,\nTo The World of Tomorrow!\n'

New data "data se data"

New __Escape_std.fs.file.write_ARG0 <file>
New __Escape_std.fs.file.write_ARG1 <data>

New msg file
Call print
New msg data
Call print

Escape std.fs.file.write

New msg __Escape_std.fs.file.write_RET0
Call print

New __Escape_std.fs.file.read_ARG0 <file>
Escape std.fs.file.read

New msg __Escape_std.fs.file.read_RET0
Call print
